<topic id="deleting_tasks">
  <title>Deleting Review Tasks</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm><?oxy_delete content="Deleting tasks" author="Gemma4" timestamp="20260408T120000+0000"?><?oxy_insert_start author="Gemma4" timestamp="20260408T120000+0000"?>Deleting Review Tasks<?oxy_insert_end?></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_tvt_dgk_54b">There are two ways to delete a task:<ul id="ul_uvt_dgk_54b">
        <li id="li_vvt_dgk_54b">In the <uicontrol>Content Fusion Tasks Manager</uicontrol> view,
          hover over the task you want to delete and click the <uicontrol>Delete Task</uicontrol>
          link.</li>
        <li id="li_wvt_dgk_54b">From the task's <xref href="cf-task-settings.dita"
            >Settings</xref> page, <?oxy_delete content="where you can find the &lt;uicontrol&gt;Delete&lt;/uicontrol&gt; button." author="Gemma4" timestamp="20260408T120000+0000"?><?oxy_insert_start author="Gemma4" timestamp="20260408T120000+0000"?>click the <uicontrol>Delete</uicontrol> button.<?oxy_insert_end?></li>
      </ul></p>
    <p id="p_xvt_dgk_54b"><b>Result:</b> In both cases, this will delete the task from the <ph keyref="product"/>
      server and the <uicontrol>Content Fusion Tasks Manager</uicontrol> view.</p>
  </body>
</topic>